 e players who execute plays consistently at a high level.\nB – Upper Int
 ermediate. Above average players who can bump\, set and spike consistently
 ..\n\nIf you're a recreational or beginning player please register for ou
 r Wednesday or Friday night leagues.\n\nOUT Sports League provides fun\, r
 ecreation\, and social sports league to Central Florida's LGBTQ+ community
 . Our Indoor Volleyball league is designed to be inclusive of people of sk
 ill levels and backgrounds. All of our leagues offer a great opportunity t
 o meet other people in our community in a fun\, friendly\, and accepting a
 tmosphere. Following the games we'll go to District Dive where you'll get 
 a FREE DRINK ticket every week. This season is sponsored by Pineapple Heal
 thcare.\n\nCreate a TEAM! On Thursdays you can become a TEAM CAPTAIN and h
 ave your players register as TEAM PLAYERS. Please note our leagues have a 
 fixed capacity of 96 players\, if your team is incomplete when registratio
 n closes or capacity is reached the league will add free agents to your te
 am.\n\nDon't have a Team? Register as a FREE AGENT and we will place you o
 n a team. Free agents can also name a FRIEND(S) that they want to play wit
 h and the league will place you together.\n\n❤️ 🧡 💛 💚 💙 
 💜🖤\n\nLEAGUE INFORMATION\n\n8 Week Indoor Volleyball Season\nThursda
 ys from July 9 - August 27\nMatches will start at 6:20\, 7:10 and 8:00pm
 \n\n- Players must be Advanced or Upper Intermediate Skill Levels (A/B).\n
 - 12 Teams Maximum. Competitive Teams must have 8 players.\n- 6v6 matches 
 with standard rotating rules\, no libero players and rally scoring.\n- Gam
 es are to 21 (win by 2 or first to 25). Always play all 3 games.\n- All ga
 mes are refereed. Each team is required to contribute line judges.\n\nGame
 s are played at:\nDover Shores Neighborhood Center\n1400 Gaston Foster Rd
 \, Orlando\, FL 32812\n\nWeekly after parties at:\nDistrict Dive\n2401 E S
 outh St\, Orlando\, FL 32803\n\nREGISTRATION INFORMATION\n\n$70 per Player
 \nLeague Fee Covers - T-Shirt\, Fields\, Equipment\, Umpires\, Photos\, Aw
 ards\, and Weekly After Party!\n\nTEAM CAPTAIN* - Create a team of 8+ and 
 invite your friends!\nTEAM PLAYER - Join an existing team (please only joi
 n if invited to a team)\nFREE AGENT - Don't have a team? No problem! Regis
 ter without a team and you can list friends you want to play with. When le
 ague registration closes you will placed on a team.\n\nWant to play with a
  few friends?\nIf you have a buddy or a small group of friends who want to
  play together you can all register as Free Agents. During registration yo
 u will be prompted to list player(s) that you'd like to play with. Everyon
 e should register separately and the league will then place you and your f
 riends together on a team.\n\n* Please note the league has a fixed capacit
 y of 96 players\, if your team is incomplete when registration closes or c
 apacity is reached the league will add free agents to your team.\n\nFAQ\n
 \nI don't have a team\, can I still play?\nYes\, register as an Individual
  and we will place you with a team.\n\nI will miss a few weeks\, can I sti
 ll play?\nYes\, all teams have extra players on them just in case you're a
 bsent on a given week. Teams can also use substitute players.\n\nHow do I 
 make sure my friend and I play on the same team?\nDuring registration ther
 e is a field where you can list the friend(s) you want to play with and th
 e league will place you together.\n\nI don't know how to play or don't thi
 nk I'll be very good\, should I play?\nYes\, join our Wednesday or Friday 
 Night leagues aimed at new and developing players and you will learn the b
 asics in a fun\, encouraging environment.\n\nI'm not LGBTQ+\, can I still 
 play?\nYes\, we are accepting to all people as long as you consider yourse
 lf an ally to our community.\n\nMore info: https://outsportsleague.leaguea
 pps.com/leagues/volleyball-(indoor)/5048669-thursdays---competitive-ab
LOCATION:Dover Shores Community Center
URL:https://outsportsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(indoor)/504
 8669-thursdays---competitive-ab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Out Sports League] Fridays - Draft/REMIX League (A/B/C/D)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T182000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T210000
UID:Out_Sports_League-Fridays_-_Draft/REMIX_League_(A/B/C/D)-2026-07-24T18
 :20:00
DESCRIPTION:ONLY ACCEPTING PLAYERS INTO THE A/B (ADVANCED/UPPER INTERMEDI
 ATE) DIVISION\nIF YOU REGISTER AS A C/D PLAYER YOU WILL BE PLACED ON THE W
 AIT LIST AND REFUNDED\n\nFRIDAY NIGHTS: DRAFT/REMIX LEAGUE\nWelcome to our
  new Friday Night Draft Indoor Volleyball League\, this league will contai
 n 2 divisions containing of players of the following skill levels:\n\nCOMP
 ETITIVE DIVISION\nA – Advanced. Experienced and competitive players who 
 execute plays consistently at a high level.\nB – Upper Intermediate. Abo
 ve average players who can bump\, set and spike consistently.\n\nRECREATIO
 NAL DIVISION\nC – Lower Intermediate. Improving players who inconsistent
 ly perform 3 hits and can't spike with power.\nD – Novice / Beginner. Re
 creational players who are learning the rules and basic skills of the game
 .\n\nOUT Sports League provides fun\, recreation\, and social sports leagu
 e to Central Florida's LGBTQ+ community. Our Indoor Volleyball league is d
 esigned to be inclusive of people of skill levels and backgrounds. We offe
 r a Social Division (for beginners or players interested in a relaxed\, fu
 n atmosphere)\, and a Competitive Divisions (only players with prior indoo
 r volleyball experience who are secure in the rules are encouraged to play
  in the competitive division). All of our leagues offer a great opportunit
 y to meet other people in our community in a fun\, friendly\, and acceptin
 g atmosphere. Following the games we'll go to District Dive where you'll g
 et a FREE DRINK ticket every week.\n\nThis is a Draft/Remix League where a
 ll players register as an INDIVIDUAL. All players may name one (1) other p
 layer during registration that they'd like to be placed on a team with. Te
 ams will be created by a Captain's Draft or by the League.\n\n❤️ 🧡 
 💛 💚 💙 💜🖤\n\nLEAGUE INFORMATION\n\n8 Week Indoor Volleyball 
 Season\nFridays from July 10 - August 28\nCompetitive (A/B) and Recreation
 al (C/D) Divisions\nMatches will start at 6:20\, 7:10 and 8:00pm\n\n- 12 T
 eams Maximum with divisions determined by registration\n- Recreational Tea
 ms will have 9 players\, Competitive Teams will have 8 players.\n- 6v6 ma
 tches with standard rotating rules\, no libero players and rally scoring\n
 - Games are to 21 (win by 2 or first to 25). Always play all 3 games.\n- A
 ll games are refereed. Each team is required to contribute line judges.\n
 \nGames are played at:\nDover Shores Neighborhood Center\n1400 Gaston Fost
 er Rd\, Orlando\, FL 32812\n\nWeekly after parties at:\nDistrict Dive\n240
 1 E South St\, Orlando\, FL 32803\n\nREGISTRATION INFORMATION\n\n$70 per P
 layer\nLeague Fee Covers - T-Shirt\, Fields\, Equipment\, Umpires\, Photos
 \, Awards\, and Weekly After Party!\n\nINDIVIDUAL - All players register a
 s an Individual. When league registration closes you will placed on a tea
 m.\n\nWant to play with a friend?\nIn a Draft/Remix Season players are per
 mitted to list one (1) other player that they'd like to be placed on a tea
 m with. Please make sure you and your friend list each other when prompted
  during registration. Chains of friends are not permitted.\n\nFAQ\n\nI do
 n't have a team\, can I still play?\nYes\, register as an Individual and w
 e will place you with a team.\n\nI will miss a few weeks\, can I still pla
 y?\nYes\, all teams have extra players on them just in case you're absent 
 on a given week. Teams can also use substitute players.\n\nHow do I make s
 ure my friend and I play on the same team?\nDuring registration there is a
  field where you can list the friend you want to play with and the league 
 will place you together.\n\nI don't know how to play or don't think I'll b
 e very good\, should I play?\nYes\, join our Wednesday or Friday Night lea
 gues aimed at new and developing players and you will learn the basics in 
 a fun\, encouraging environment.\n\nI'm not LGBTQ+\, can I still play?\nYe
 s\, we are accepting to all people as long as you consider yourself an all
 y to our community.\n\nMore info: https://outsportsleague.leagueapps.com/l
 eagues/volleyball-(indoor)/5048670-fridays---draftremix-league-abcd
LOCATION:Dover Shores Community Center
URL:https://outsportsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(indoor)/504
 8670-fridays---draftremix-league-abcd
