 ague is the required insurance for the contracts to rent and utilize the p
 laying facilities.\n\nFAQ\n\nI don't have a team\, can I still play?\nYes
 \, register as an Individual and we will place you with a team.\n\nI will 
 miss a few weeks\, can I still play?\nYes\, all teams have extra players o
 n them just in case you're absent on a given week. Teams can also use subs
 titute players.\n\nHow do I make sure my friend and I play on the same tea
 m?\nDuring registration there is a field where you can list the friend(s) 
 you want to play with and the league will place you together.\n\nI don't k
 now how to play or don't think I'll be very good\, should I play?\nYes\, j
 oin our social division and you will learn the basics in a fun\, encouragi
 ng environment.\n\nI'm not LGBTQ+\, can I still play?\nYes\, we are accept
 ing to all people as long as you consider yourself an ally to our communit
 y.\n\nAny other questions? Contact us at info@outsportsleague.com\n\nMore 
