BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Out Sports League] Orlando Friday SAND VOLLEYBALL
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T182000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T220000
UID:Out_Sports_League-Orlando_Friday_SAND_VOLLEYBALL-2026-10-23T18:20:00
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to OUT Sports League SAND VOLLEYBALL!\n\nCome join us 
 on Friday nights at Festival Park where we'll be playing on the sand and u
 nder the lights starting at 6:20pm. The league will contain 2 divisions\, 
 Social and Competitive\, to accommodate players of any skill level. Don't 
 have a team? Or have a few friends who want to play together? Register a
 s a FREE AGENT and meet some people! Or get some friends together and star
 t a TEAM (see details below). Following the games we'll go to District Div
 e where you'll get a FREE DRINK ticket every week.\n\nThis season OUT Spor
 ts League is sponsored by Pineapple Healthcare!\n\nLEAGUE INFORMATION\n\n8
  Week Beach Volleyball Season\nFridays from October 2 - November 20\nDepen
 ding on the amount of teams\, matches will start at 6:20\, 7:05\, 7:50\, 8
 :40 and 9:30\n\nMatches will be 5 vs 5.\n20 Teams Maximum with minimum of
  7 people per team. (When the league hits capacity (150 players) registra
 tion will close and Free Agents will be assigned to incomplete teams.)\nTh
 e League contains 2 divisions: Social and Competitive\n\nGames are played 
 at:\nOrlando Festival Park Beach Volleyball Courts\n400 Festival Way\, Orl
 ando\, FL 32803\n\nWe will use standard rotating rules and rally scoring\n
 Games are to 21 (win by 2 or first to 25)\nAlways play all 3 games\nIf tim
 e is short\, play 3rd game to first to 15 points\n\nLEAGUE REGISTRATION IN
 FO\n\n$50 per player \nLeague Fee Covers - T-Shirt\, Lights\, Courts\, Eq
 uipment\, Awards\, Insurance\, Weekly After Party!\n\nTEAM CAPTAIN* - Crea
 te a team of 7+ and invite your friends! \nTEAM PLAYER - Join an existing
  team (please only join if invited to a team)\nFREE AGENT   - Don't have 
 a team? No problem! Register without a team and you can list friends you w
 ant to play with. When league registration closes you will placed on a tea
 m.\n\nWant to play with a few friends?\nIf you have a buddy or a small gro
 up of friends who want to play together you can all register as Free Agent
 s. During registration you will be prompted to list player(s) that you'd l
 ike to play with. Everyone should register separately and the league will 
 then place you and your friends together on a team.\n\n*When the league hi
 ts capacity (150 players) or registration closes\, Free Agents will be ad
 ded to incomplete teams to get their rosters to a minimum of 7 players.\n
 \nOTHER INFO\n\nNo skill or prior experience is required.\nWeekly After Pa
 rty will be at District Dive.\n\nAll participants in all leagues and event
 s should have their own insurance otherwise you will play at your own risk
 . OUT Sports League DOES NOT provide insurance for participants. ALL parti
 cipants are required to sign a waiver during registration. Any player who 
 does not sign the OUT Sports League Waiver will not be allowed to particip
 ate\, no exceptions are made. The only insurance provided by OUT Sports Le
 ague is the required insurance for the contracts to rent and utilize the p
 laying facilities.\n\nFAQ\n\nI don't have a team\, can I still play?\nYes
 \, register as an Individual and we will place you with a team.\n\nI will 
 miss a few weeks\, can I still play?\nYes\, all teams have extra players o
 n them just in case you're absent on a given week. Teams can also use subs
 titute players.\n\nHow do I make sure my friend and I play on the same tea
 m?\nDuring registration there is a field where you can list the friend(s) 
 you want to play with and the league will place you together.\n\nI don't k
 now how to play or don't think I'll be very good\, should I play?\nYes\, j
 oin our social division and you will learn the basics in a fun\, encouragi
 ng environment.\n\nI'm not LGBTQ+\, can I still play?\nYes\, we are accept
 ing to all people as long as you consider yourself an ally to our communit
 y.\n\nAny other questions? Contact us at info@outsportsleague.com\n\nMore 
 info: https://outsportsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(sand)/512
 9310-orlando-friday-sand-volleyball
LOCATION:Festival Park Volleyball Courts
URL:https://outsportsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(sand)/51293
